silm:instances_papers_09_minimal_category_theory_chapters_08_cross_paper_bridges_sections_03_bridge_to_11_base_commutative_diagram_yoneda_hom_leg_0_classification_leg silm:hasExample "In 'S03BridgeTo11BaseCommutativeDiagramYonedaHomLeg0', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, the Mittens -> DomesticCat classification leg (JoC 3.1 type arrow); admissible only when c factors through the cocone apex, never as identity" .
